   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the highway law, in relation to designating a portion of the\nstate highway system as the \"Trooper William P. Keane Memorial Bridge\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S4564",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4564-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
